[2.212, "o", "Feedback     Pretty dress but the material is not as soft as I hoped.\r\nTier         medium   (low 0.20 | medium 0.60 | high 0.20)\r\nAction       manual_review   human review: yes\r\nTriggers     none\r\nExplanation  Pretty dress but the material is not as soft as I hoped. The model rated\r\n             the risk level as medium due to the complaint about the material being less\r\n             soft than expected, which indicates a moderate level of dissatisfaction.\r\nSource       llm\r\n"]
