[1.448, "o", "Feedback     Fell apart in the wash. Worst purchase ever, I want a refund!\r\nTier         high   (low 0.01 | medium 0.03 | high 0.96)\r\nAction       escalate_immediately   human review: yes\r\nTriggers     none\r\nExplanation  Fell apart in the wash. Worst purchase ever, I want a refund! The model\r\n             rated the risk level as high due to the high probability (0.958) of a\r\n             significant issue with the product.\r\nSource       llm\r\n"]
